fix: stop 1-2s recording death and yellow border from Chromium audio

- Spawn FFmpeg with -nostdin so a closed stdin no longer ends capture with code 0
- Do not use Chromium desktop loopback for system audio (that paintsthe yellow border)
- Prefer DirectShow / game-capture audio instead; Rage/FiveM-style titles start on WGC
- Instant Replay no longer starts Chromium loopback; recover early FFmpeg exits via gdigrab retry
